    "body": "- [ ] I, the PR author, have personally reviewed every line of this PR.\n\n## What does this PR do?\n\nThe PR template currently does not ask authors to declare code provenance. Add a choice between independent development and documented external code, with source URLs/revisions, affected files, applicable licenses, required attribution, and an author acknowledgment.\n\nAdd an explicit `AGENTS.md` instruction prohibiting copying or adapting code from other repositories and requiring provenance review before opening a PR.\n\nLinked issue: [MCORE-1013](https://linear.app/nvidia/issue/MCORE-1013/add-external-code-provenance-requirements-to-the-pr-template-and)\n\nRepository covered: `NVIDIA/Megatron-LM` (`.github/pull_request_template.md` and `AGENTS.md`).\n\n## Code provenance\n\n- [x] I developed these changes independently and did not copy or adapt code from external sources.\n- [ ] This PR includes code copied or adapted from external sources, documented below.\n\nExternal code details: N/A. These are independently written documentation changes; no external code is introduced.\n\n- [x] I have reviewed the provenance of these changes and included all required license notices and attribution.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `BASE_REF=main CHECK_ONLY=true SKIP_DOCS=false bash tools/autoformat.sh` passed; no changed Python files required formatting.\n- Reviewed both files against the issue requirements. Unit and functional tests are not applicable to this documentation-only change.\n",
